<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Petco rated outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Petco rated outperform.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Petco Animal Supplies Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 5/8 at 28-5/8.</p>
</text>
